Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.49,0:00:07.69,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去寻找吧 收集起梦的碎片{\fad(250,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.57,0:00:18.70,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,即使胸中苦闷 去感受真切的现在吧{\fad(0,400)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.61,0:00:23.58,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比外表更单纯
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.32,0:00:27.22,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是却无法传达
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.02,0:00:34.55,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想要说的话 总是藏在口袋里
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.23,0:00:41.26,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,充满孩子气的话语 如今已无法开口
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.70,0:00:49.20,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽说时间会冲淡一切 我们却无法相互理解
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.47,0:00:55.47,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,24小时 一直相信着你
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.71,0:00:59.21,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看着你
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.25,0:01:03.95,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,即使只是俗常的话语
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.32,0:01:10.26,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,时间总是 微笑着匆匆流逝
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.30,0:01:21.76,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比起回忆 还是去追求理想的今天{\fad(0,1025)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.60,0:01:39.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,森林 松鼠
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.37,0:01:43.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,紫罗兰 莲藕…唉呀？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.84,0:01:49.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,令尊的知交 在这么偏僻的森林中吗
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.58,0:01:56.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来的好 我一直在等你
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.59,0:01:59.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从空中传来声音
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.59,0:02:02.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么都没有
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.93,0:02:10.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我正想差不多 该是你来的时候了 杀生丸
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.00,0:02:13.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你早就知道我会来了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.54,0:02:15.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,朴仙翁
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.11,0:02:22.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你来找我是为了刀的事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.03,0:02:40.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,第51话 犬夜叉的心被吃了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.64,0:02:55.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉都告诉我了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.01,0:02:58.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在我追琥珀的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.68,0:03:01.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒你想做什么
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.75,0:03:02.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有毒蜂啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.55,0:03:04.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,风穴
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.69,0:03:10.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.79,0:03:13.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你连毒蜂也吸进去了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.07,0:03:20.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉 你去追珊瑚还有戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.74,0:03:26.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不惜牺牲自己战斗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.44,0:03:27.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只为了我和琥珀
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.69,0:03:37.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琥珀
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.42,0:03:43.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀了你之后我也会自杀
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.26,0:03:47.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为了把你从奈落手里夺回
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.83,0:03:49.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只有这么做了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.14,0:03:53.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起 琥珀
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.31,0:03:58.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,住手 珊瑚
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.49,0:04:11.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起 弥勒法师
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.42,0:04:15.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都是我而害你 吸入了那些毒虫的毒
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.46,0:04:20.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊…瑚
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.40,0:04:22.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.47,0:04:25.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要一副那么难过的样子嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.67,0:04:29.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琥珀的事情…还有希望
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.91,0:04:32.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒法师
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.34,0:04:35.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以…笑一个
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.85,0:04:40.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.56,0:04:45.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒法师？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.99,0:04:48.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等一下 不要 振作点
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.99,0:04:50.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,振作一点 法师…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.27,0:05:01.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚 我打水来了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.57,0:05:02.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒的状况如何
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.87,0:05:05.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好像已经好多了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.72,0:05:15.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想知道的事情是
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.72,0:05:19.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你父亲的遗物 铁碎牙吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.72,0:05:20.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还是…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.66,0:05:22.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,树木妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.09,0:05:25.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀生丸少爷 这东西到底是…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.30,0:05:28.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,树龄两千年的朴树
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.30,0:05:31.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.10,0:05:35.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且杀生丸的父亲所遗留的刀
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.61,0:05:39.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,铁碎牙与天生牙的刀鞘
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.48,0:05:42.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是用我的枝干削出来的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.11,0:05:46.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刀鞘…原来那把刀的刀鞘
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.55,0:05:49.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是用这家伙的枝干做的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.19,0:05:51.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刀鞘不可思议的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.56,0:05:54.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看到这家伙也就可想而知了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.06,0:05:58.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,朴仙翁 你应该知道
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.33,0:06:02.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉与铁碎牙的关系
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.57,0:06:06.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉…你同父异母的弟弟吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.14,0:06:09.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉的血已经变了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.77,0:06:13.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,第一次是铁碎牙 被鬼咬碎的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.45,0:06:16.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,第二次是和我缠斗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.45,0:06:18.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放开铁碎牙的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.96,0:06:30.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去死吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.97,0:06:35.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这气味…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.61,0:06:46.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从半妖之血的气味
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.98,0:06:48.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,变成和我与父亲一样
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.11,0:06:50.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妖怪之血的气味
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.05,0:06:54.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,同样的妖怪之血吗…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.32,0:06:56.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不见得吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.89,0:07:00.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这话怎么说
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.99,0:07:05.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉是 妖怪与人类所生的半妖
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.40,0:07:08.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,无法成为真正的妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.07,0:07:13.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他和你不同 杀生丸
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.50,0:07:17.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,纯碎的妖怪的你做得到的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.71,0:07:20.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对犬夜叉而言是却做不到的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.84,0:07:23.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉做不到的事情？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.78,0:07:27.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就是 保护自己
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.65,0:07:29.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,保护自己？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.65,0:07:32.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错 好比说杀生丸
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.16,0:07:38.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你从来没有在战斗中 被逼得走投无路
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.93,0:07:44.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因而心灰意冷到失去自我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.24,0:07:47.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要把我逼到走投无路
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.37,0:07:48.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,根本是不可能的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.61,0:07:52.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许真是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.04,0:07:55.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是犬夜叉不一样
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.45,0:08:00.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在走投无路 生命垂危的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.45,0:08:01.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为了保护自己
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.89,0:08:06.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妖怪之血就会支配身体而妖化
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.96,0:08:09.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是那时候的…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.06,0:08:15.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是犬夜叉从你父亲身上
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.77,0:08:17.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,继承的大妖怪之血
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.90,0:08:20.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对半妖的身体而言太强烈了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.70,0:08:22.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如此一来 会怎样
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.97,0:08:24.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.91,0:08:28.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,心会被妖怪之血吞噬
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.08,0:08:32.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,连自己是谁都分不清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.18,0:08:36.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,甚至会敌我不分的杀戮
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.92,0:08:39.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且在不断反覆妖化中
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.06,0:08:42.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总有一日犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.26,0:08:44.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,会完全丧失理智
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.43,0:08:49.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最后化身为只会战斗的怪物
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.57,0:08:53.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,持续战斗至身体毁灭为止
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.48,0:09:05.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你父亲应该不希望 犬夜叉变成那样
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.08,0:09:12.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以才会将当作 护身之刀的铁碎牙交给他
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.72,0:09:15.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,铁碎牙是护身之刀？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.73,0:09:19.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,将它放开的时候 犬夜叉就…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.24,0:09:28.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总觉得犬夜叉成熟多了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.24,0:09:30.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.47,0:09:31.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是在夸奖你
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.84,0:09:34.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不管怎样 你救了琥珀一命
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.31,0:09:39.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是不想 让奈落称心如意而已
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.98,0:09:41.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要是能让琥珀活着回来
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.75,0:09:44.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那家伙一定会气个半死
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.52,0:09:46.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又在说反话了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.89,0:09:47.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.26,0:09:51.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为戈薇还活着
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.50,0:09:55.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你担心我吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.73,0:09:56.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那还用说
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.97,0:10:00.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其实我也有点不安
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.00,0:10:03.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为犬夜叉一直没有来
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.64,0:10:07.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伤口还很痛吧？让我看一下
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.28,0:10:10.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不用了 我自己治疗过了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.28,0:10:12.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不好好彻底治疗的话
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.25,0:10:14.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要是更严重怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.15,0:10:15.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没关系啦
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.52,0:10:16.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不行啦
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.99,0:10:18.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的没事的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.26,0:10:19.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么可能没事
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.26,0:10:20.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是真的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.66,0:10:23.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉 我是想道谢的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.86,0:10:26.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,道谢 是指什么…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.03,0:10:30.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你们 戈薇 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.17,0:10:32.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你们陪伴着我
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.17,0:10:34.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,打扰啦
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.81,0:10:39.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,陪伴着她？那是应该的吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.96,0:10:56.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.19,0:10:58.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,声音从那边传来的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.20,0:11:02.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.83,0:11:04.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我爷爷 我爷爷他…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.70,0:11:05.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妖怪吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.04,0:11:08.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在哪里 老头
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.81,0:11:10.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妖怪跑哪去了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.31,0:11:18.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这家伙没有妖怪的气息啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.48,0:11:22.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里 在这里啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.59,0:11:25.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的脚不小心踩空了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.46,0:11:28.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什~么~
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.36,0:11:31.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,得救了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.73,0:11:33.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,搞什么
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.10,0:11:37.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还以为妖怪出现 让人担心个半死
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.47,0:11:38.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是太好了 爷爷
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.74,0:11:41.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是十分感谢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.24,0:11:44.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我扭到脚正不知所措呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.11,0:11:48.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,承蒙各位这样照顾
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.25,0:11:50.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哪里哪里 举手之劳而已
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.75,0:11:52.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,您就别放在心上了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.75,0:11:54.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是吧犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.15,0:11:57.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的是谢谢你们
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.76,0:11:59.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是村子
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.46,0:12:01.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的 我看见了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.26,0:12:08.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么您保重了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.00,0:12:11.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你 姐姐
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.50,0:12:13.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有妖怪狗哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.04,0:12:15.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妖怪狗…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.64,0:12:16.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.27,0:12:19.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的宝物送给你当谢礼
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.18,0:12:26.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再见了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.18,0:12:28.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他给了你什么
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.39,0:12:30.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,蛇蜕下的皮
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.79,0:12:33.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是蛇的蜕皮吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.02,0:12:37.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真好呢 犬夜叉给我嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.13,0:12:44.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.80,0:12:47.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明明就没有时间去帮别人了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.50,0:12:49.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,反正是举手之劳嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.44,0:12:51.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你每次做了好事之后
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.18,0:12:54.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就一定会变的很不爽呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.45,0:12:58.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.68,0:12:59.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.82,0:13:02.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是人血的味道
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.52,0:13:03.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.52,0:13:05.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且人数还不少
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.43,0:13:09.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,冒起烟来了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.96,0:13:13.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那不是刚才老头 与小鬼的村子的方向吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.33,0:13:15.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们被什么袭击了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.24,0:13:27.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是刚才的孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.25,0:13:30.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爷爷…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.98,0:13:34.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,振作一点
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.12,0:13:35.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.22,0:13:36.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快去救他
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.09,0:13:39.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇 治疗一下小鬼的伤
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.49,0:13:41.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.59,0:13:44.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚 你留在这里保护戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.86,0:13:45.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.23,0:13:47.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们走 弥勒
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.26,0:13:47.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没问题
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.15,0:14:11.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这村子我很中意
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.29,0:14:13.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在食物吃完前就待在这里吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.22,0:14:16.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,女人通通集中在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.46,0:14:17.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,逃跑的就杀掉
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.90,0:14:25.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是强盗吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.90,0:14:27.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,臭家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.68,0:14:32.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.81,0:14:34.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们这些小喽罗等等再收拾
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.91,0:14:35.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,叫头目出来
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.78,0:14:38.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉 强盗群中…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.05,0:14:40.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我闻到了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.92,0:14:43.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有只妖怪混在里面
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.80,0:14:56.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小子…你的刀挺有意思的嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.70,0:14:59.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就是妖怪吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.54,0:15:01.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,居然率领着强盗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.18,0:15:07.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,头目是妖怪？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.58,0:15:08.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,胡说八道
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.85,0:15:12.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小鬼 那把刀交出来
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.08,0:15:16.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么？你还没睡醒啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.65,0:15:18.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别大意 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.56,0:15:21.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你以为我会输吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.20,0:15:31.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不交出那把刀 我就用抢的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.80,0:15:35.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有意思 抢得到就来抢啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.71,0:15:38.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉应该还无法随心所欲
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.88,0:15:40.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,使用很重的铁碎牙
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.74,0:15:42.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有问题吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.21,0:15:47.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要扒掉你那伪装的皮 妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.76,0:16:00.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊啊！头目
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.56,0:16:02.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,头目的大钺被…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.77,0:16:04.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,活该
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.00,0:16:09.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是锋利的刀
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.64,0:16:13.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,知道的话就纳命来
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.01,0:16:15.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里有面盾呢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.42,0:16:20.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,搞什么
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.03,0:16:31.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你已经中了我的毒粉了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.17,0:16:38.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.17,0:16:45.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是把好刀 我愈来愈中意了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.45,0:16:49.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,糟了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.75,0:17:29.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让你们束手无策
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.72,0:17:34.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.76,0:17:35.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,头目…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.53,0:17:39.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们这是怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.43,0:17:43.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,知道我是妖怪就怕了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.03,0:17:45.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没那回事
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.64,0:17:47.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有这么厉害的妖怪当头目
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.44,0:17:48.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们是无敌的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.54,0:17:51.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们会像以前一样跟随您的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.81,0:17:57.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嘿嘿 活该
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.55,0:18:03.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是毒茧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.29,0:18:06.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一不留神碰到的话会融化的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.56,0:18:10.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,里面的家伙 马上就会尸骨无存了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.02,0:18:24.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是毒茧 一直碰的话
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.36,0:18:27.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不论是谁都会溶化的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.76,0:18:30.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刚才那些家伙也是
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.84,0:18:41.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有溶化？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.81,0:18:46.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从内部张开了结界啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.71,0:18:49.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉 你还能动吗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.08,0:18:50.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那当然了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.05,0:18:53.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这种烂茧我马上撕破它
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.32,0:18:57.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.36,0:19:03.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,身体无法动弹了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.83,0:19:05.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刚才让你淋到的毒粉
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.20,0:19:08.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,已经从伤口进入体内了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.10,0:19:11.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就这样一步步去见阎王吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.34,0:19:16.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拿过来
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.61,0:19:17.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.31,0:19:20.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,铁碎牙被…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.34,0:19:22.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,头目请
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.35,0:19:30.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他被铁碎牙的结界拒绝了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.36,0:19:33.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,头目？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.13,0:19:38.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,臭小子 这怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.60,0:19:41.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么刀会拒绝我
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.93,0:19:47.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的铁碎牙会选择主人
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.34,0:19:50.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是说像你这种杂碎妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.37,0:19:52.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,根本不配持有它
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.14,0:19:56.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,意思是这些 杂碎般的人类强盗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.11,0:19:58.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是被刀选上的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.88,0:20:02.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说杂碎太狠了吧 头目
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.39,0:20:11.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对了 你这小鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.39,0:20:12.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是个半妖对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.87,0:20:18.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这真是太滑稽了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.70,0:20:21.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你一个区区的半妖
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.37,0:20:24.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,竟敢向我妖怪蛾天丸找碴
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.21,0:20:30.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太慢了 一定是在村子出事了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.42,0:20:33.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.45,0:20:34.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我好担心爷爷
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.19,0:20:37.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.42,0:20:42.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉的伤口
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.93,0:20:45.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不但没有好 反而愈来愈大了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.76,0:20:49.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶 血止不住
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.40,0:20:51.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是毒粉的关系吗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.84,0:20:53.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,糟糕了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.24,0:20:56.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是张开结界就很勉强了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.74,0:20:58.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有办法活动
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.41,0:21:02.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但这结界能撑到什么时候呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.95,0:21:06.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个 头目 这把刀…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.98,0:21:09.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,随你处置吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.72,0:21:11.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我对不能用的刀没兴趣
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.99,0:21:14.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢头目
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.96,0:21:20.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那把刀无论如何
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.13,0:21:23.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,非交给那个人不可
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.53,0:21:24.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真好耶
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.54,0:21:26.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这把刀真不得了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.24,0:21:35.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,结界破掉 被毒茧融化 是迟早的问题
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.98,0:21:38.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就在这里等着看好戏吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.99,0:21:47.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把女孩带过来
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.04,0:22:01.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.79,0:22:30.49,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,何不把真正重要的事物以外{\fad(500,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.83,0:22:42.17,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,全部 都舍弃呢
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.08,0:22:49.45,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现实 往往是如此残酷
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.35,0:22:53.05,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但每当 遇到这种时刻
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.32,0:22:57.55,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只要紧闭双眼
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.06,0:23:04.55,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,便能看见 你的笑容{\fad(0,900)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.60,0:23:12.20,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Ah- 但愿从此以往
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.97,0:23:19.81,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,直到进入 沉眠的那一刻
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.51,0:23:27.21,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的 那抹笑容
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.92,0:23:35.16,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都绝没有 消逝的瞬间{\fad(0,900)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.05,0:23:51.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,被毒蛾妖怪蛾天丸 困在毒茧中的犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.88,0:23:53.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,受到凶猛的妖怪之血支配
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.12,0:23:56.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,毫不留情的杀光强盗们
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.16,0:23:59.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎样才能解除犬夜叉的妖化呢
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.03,0:24:01.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒法师 珊瑚
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.43,0:24:03.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快想个让他恢复原状的办法
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.03,0:24:06.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么在这麻烦时刻
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.40,0:24:07.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,连杀生丸都出现了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.87,0:24:10.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,次回 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.27,0:24:13.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,扼止不了的妖怪本性
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.47,0:24:14.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,敬请期待
